# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform (whatever
# `core.autocrlf` says): package templates are copied byte for byte into
# roasted datasets, whose text files are UTF-8 with LF everywhere
# (docs/design/architecture.md, Conventions, "Platforms").
* text=auto eol=lf
# Protocol printouts are kept as they were published (some have CRLF)
printouts/** -text
# Binary files
*.nii binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.mgz binary
*.pdf binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
